{"id": "5af05-cah73", "created": "2025-07-17T18:34:20.076563+00:00", "updated": "2025-07-17T18:34:20.157326+00:00", "links": {"self": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73", "self_html": "https://data.caltech.edu/records/5af05-cah73", "preview_html": "https://data.caltech.edu/records/5af05-cah73?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.22002/5af05-cah73", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.22002/5af05-cah73", "self_doi_html": "https://data.caltech.edu/doi/10.22002/5af05-cah73", "reserve_doi": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/3yryp-bxg98", "parent_html": "https://data.caltech.edu/records/3yryp-bxg98", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/iiif/record:5af05-cah73/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/iiif/record:5af05-cah73/sequence/default", "files": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/files", "media_files": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/media-files", "latest": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://data.caltech.edu/records/5af05-cah73/latest", "versions": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/versions", "draft": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/draft", "access_links": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/access/links", "access_grants": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/access/grants", "access_users": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/access/users", "access_request": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/access/request", "access": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/access", "communities": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/communities-suggestions", "requests": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/requests"}, "revision_id": 3, "parent": {"id": "3yryp-bxg98", "access": {"owned_by": {"user": "375"}}, "communities": {}, "pids": {}}, "versions": {"is_latest": true, "index": 2}, "is_published": true, "is_draft": false, "pids": {"doi": {"identifier": "10.22002/5af05-cah73", "provider": "datacite", "client": "datacite"}, "oai": {"identifier": "oai:data.caltech.edu:5af05-cah73", "provider": "oai"}}, "metadata": {"resource_type": {"id": "dataset", "title": {"en": "Dataset"}}, "creators": [{"person_or_org": {"type": "personal", "name": "Atterholt, James", "given_name": "James", "family_name": "Atterholt", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "0000-0003-1603-5518", "scheme": "orcid"}]}, "role": {"id": "projectleader", "title": {"en": "Project leader"}}, "affiliations": [{"id": "05dxps055", "name": "California Institute of Technology", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "05dxps055", "scheme": "ror"}]}, {"id": "035a68863", "name": "United States Geological Survey", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "035a68863", "scheme": "ror"}]}]}, {"person_or_org": {"type": "personal", "name": "Wilding, John", "given_name": "John", "family_name": "Wilding", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "0000-0002-0914-2078", "scheme": "orcid"}]}, "role": {"id": "projectmember", "title": {"en": "Project member"}}, "affiliations": [{"id": "05dxps055", "name": "California Institute of Technology", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "05dxps055", "scheme": "ror"}]}]}, {"person_or_org": {"type": "personal", "name": "Ross, Zachary", "given_name": "Zachary", "family_name": "Ross", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "0000-0002-6343-8400", "scheme": "orcid"}]}, "role": {"id": "projectmember", "title": {"en": "Project member"}}, "affiliations": [{"id": "05dxps055", "name": "California Institute of Technology", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "05dxps055", "scheme": "ror"}]}]}], "title": "2019 Ridgecrest Earthquake Sequence Long-Term Hypocenter and Moment Tensor Catalog (Version 2)", "publisher": "CaltechDATA", "publication_date": "2025-07-17", "dates": [{"date": "2025-01-01", "type": {"id": "available", "title": {"de": "Verf\u00fcgbar", "en": "Available"}}}], "rights": [{"id": "cc0-1.0", "title": {"en": "Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal"}, "description": {"en": "CC0 waives copyright interest in a work you've created and dedicates it to the world-wide public domain. Use CC0 to opt out of copyright entirely and ensure your work has the widest reach."}, "icon": "cc-cc0-icon", "props": {"url": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode", "scheme": "spdx"}}], "description": "<p>This is the new preferred version of the catalog produced in Atterholt, Wilding, &amp; Ross (2025). This update corrects a parameter choice in the relative relocation step (tdif_fmt) that reduces scatter in the final catalog. This update does not change the results of the original study. Please cite Atterholt, Wilding, &amp; Ross (2025) if using this catalog. Included are:</p><ol><li>A relocated earthquake hypocenter location catalog made using PhaseNO (Sun et al., 2023) for phase picking, GaMMA (Zhu et al., 2022) for phase association, HypoSVI (Smith et al., 2021) for absolute location, and GrowClust (Trugman &amp; Shearer, 2017) for cross-correlation-based relative relocation.</li><li>A corresponding earthquake moment tensor catalog made using the picks from the hypocenter catalog and the Bayesian framework outlined in Wilding &amp; Ross (2024).</li></ol><p>Citations:</p><ul><li>Atterholt, J., Wilding, J. D., &amp; Ross., Z. E. (2025). The evolution of fault orientation in the 2019 Ridgecrest earthquake sequence with a new long-term catalogue of seismicity and moment tensors. <i>Geophysical Journal International, 240</i>(3), 1579\u20131592. https://doi.org/10.1093/gji/ggaf001</li><li>Sun, H., Ross, Z. E., Zhu, W., &amp; Azizzadenesheli, K. (2023). Phase Neural Operator for Multi\u2010Station Picking of Seismic Arrivals. <i>Geophysical Research Letters</i>, <i>50</i>(24), e2023GL106434. https://doi.org/10.1029/2023GL106434</li><li>Zhu, W., McBrearty, I. W., Mousavi, S. M., Ellsworth, W. L., &amp; Beroza, G. C. (2022). Earthquake Phase Association Using a Bayesian Gaussian Mixture Model. <i>Journal of Geophysical Research: Solid Earth</i>, <i>127</i>(5), e2021JB023249. https://doi.org/10.1029/2021JB023249</li><li>Smith, J. D., Ross, Z. E., Azizzadenesheli, K., &amp; Muir, J. B. (2021). HypoSVI: Hypocentre inversion with Stein variational inference and physics informed neural networks. <i>Geophysical Journal International</i>, <i>228</i>(1), 698\u2013710. https://doi.org/10.1093/gji/ggab309</li><li>Trugman, D. T., &amp; Shearer, P. M. (2017). GrowClust: A Hierarchical Clustering Algorithm for Relative Earthquake Relocation, with Application to the Spanish Springs and Sheldon, Nevada, Earthquake Sequences. <i>Seismological Research Letters</i>, <i>88</i>(2A), 379\u2013391. https://doi.org/10.1785/0220160188</li></ul>", "funding": [{"funder": {"id": "021nxhr62", "name": "U.S. National Science Foundation"}, "award": {"number": "1745301", "title": {"en": "Graduate Research Fellowship"}}}]}, "custom_fields": {}, "access": {"record": "public", "files": "public", "embargo": {"active": false, "reason": null}, "status": "open"}, "files": {"enabled": true, "order": [], "count": 2, "total_bytes": 21685403, "entries": {"AWR_Hypocenter_Catalog_v2.csv": {"id": "b5c3cd6d-755b-4874-aa62-d0dd376e8b5c", "checksum": "md5:9c0feed366771d17e1cdbe93b4e1fe35", "ext": "csv", "size": 19728609, "mimetype": "text/csv", "storage_class": "L", "key": "AWR_Hypocenter_Catalog_v2.csv", "metadata": null, "access": {"hidden": false}, "links": {"self": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/files/AWR_Hypocenter_Catalog_v2.csv", "content": "https://data.caltech.edu/api/records/5af05-cah73/files/AWR_Hypocenter_Catalog_v2.csv/content"}}, "AWR_MomentTensor_Catalog_v2.csv": {"id": "7d0d5a99-1251-4e35-9317-602a82337891", "checksum": "md5:e1637514295fb9a77d8c066b35e4e668", "ext": "csv", "size": 1956794, "mimetype": "text/csv", "storage_class"